{"seq":1,"slug":"computational-creativity-theory","title":"博士 艺术与科技前沿 — 计算创造力理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/arts/arts-and-technology/ai-creativity/computational-creativity-theory","wordCount":3435,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士-艺术与科技前沿-计算创造力理论\">博士 艺术与科技前沿 — 计算创造力理论</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>计算创造力（Computational Creativity）是人工智能与认知科学交叉地带最具哲学深度的研究领域之一。它不仅追问&quot;机器能否创造&quot;，更深入探究创造力本身的结构：什么使一个产出被认定为&quot;有创意的&quot;？创造性行为能否被形式化建模？评价创造力的标准是主观审美还是可操作化的指标？</p>\n<p>Margaret Boden 在 <em>The Creative Mind</em> 中提出的三类创造力分类——探索性（exploratory）、组合性（combinational）、变革性（transformational）——至今仍是该领域最具影响力的理论框架。与此同时，Colton 的创造三脚架（Creative Tripod）模型将&quot;技巧（skill）、鉴赏力（appreciation）、想象力（imagination）&quot;作为评估计算创造力系统的三个维度，为工程实践提供了可操作的评价骨架。SPECS 框架（Standardised Procedure for Evaluating Creative Systems）则试图建立标准化的评估流程，使不同创造力系统之间的比较成为可能。</p>\n<p>本文将系统梳理这些核心理论框架，辨析&quot;计算创造力&quot;与&quot;生成式 AI&quot;之间的概念边界，并深入讨论机器创造力的哲学争议——从 Ada Lovelace 的经典反对到当代关于涌现行为（emergence）的辩论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-boden-的创造力三分法\">一、Boden 的创造力三分法</h3><p>Margaret Boden 将创造力分为三种类型，每一种都有明确的计算对应物：</p>\n<p><strong>探索性创造力（Exploratory Creativity）</strong> 在一个既有的概念空间（conceptual space）内系统地搜索新的可能性。概念空间可以形式化为一组规则、约束或风格定义。例如，爵士乐即兴演奏在和声框架内寻找未被走过的旋律路径；一个遵循十四行诗格律的诗歌生成系统在 meter + rhyme scheme 构成的空间中搜索。</p>\n<p>用集合论的语言：设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为某个概念空间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 为定义该空间的规则集合，则探索性创造力产出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\in S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 此前未被发现，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 仍满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 的所有约束。</p>\n<p><strong>组合性创造力（Combinational Creativity）</strong> 将来自不同领域的已有概念以非显然的方式重新关联。类比、隐喻、拼贴都是组合性创造力的典型表现。计算上，这对应于跨域映射——将一个领域的结构投射到另一个领域，产生新的语义连接。</p>\n<p>形式化地，给定两个概念空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，组合性创造力构建映射 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f: S_1 \\rightarrow S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 揭示此前未被注意的结构同构或语义关联。</p>\n<p><strong>变革性创造力（Transformational Creativity）</strong> 改变概念空间本身的规则。这是最激进的形式：不是在现有空间中搜索，而是重新定义空间的边界。毕加索从写实绘画转向立体主义，Schoenberg 放弃调性，都是变革性创造力的实例。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>transform</mtext></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>where </mtext><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> satisfies </mtext><msup><mi>R</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{transform}}: R \\rightarrow R&#x27; \\quad \\text{where } S&#x27; = \\{x \\mid x \\text{ satisfies } R&#x27;\\} \\neq S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transform</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">where </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> satisfies </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这三类创造力形成了一个层级结构。探索性创造力在现有框架内创新，组合性创造力跨框架关联，变革性创造力重写框架本身。大多数当前的生成式 AI 系统主要展现探索性和组合性创造力，真正的变革性创造力仍是开放难题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-colton-的创造三脚架\">二、Colton 的创造三脚架</h3><p>Simon Colton 提出的 Creative Tripod 模型认为，一个系统要被认为具有创造力，必须同时展现三个属性：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Creative System] --&gt; B[Skill&lt;br/&gt;技巧]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Appreciation&lt;br/&gt;鉴赏力]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Imagination&lt;br/&gt;想象力]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[产出的技术质量]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[对自身产出的评价能力]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[主动生成新目标的能力]\">graph TD\n    A[Creative System] --&gt; B[Skill&lt;br/&gt;技巧]\n    A --&gt; C[Appreciation&lt;br/&gt;鉴赏力]\n    A --&gt; D[Imagination&lt;br/&gt;想象力]\n    B --&gt; B1[产出的技术质量]\n    C --&gt; C1[对自身产出的评价能力]\n    D --&gt; D1[主动生成新目标的能力]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>技巧（Skill）</strong>：系统能够产出具有技术质量的作品。一个画画的 AI 必须能画出视觉上连贯的图像；一个写诗的系统必须生成语法正确、韵律合理的文本。</li>\n<li><strong>鉴赏力（Appreciation）</strong>：系统能够评价自身和他者的产出。这不仅是过滤低质量输出的能力，更是一种&quot;审美判断&quot;的模拟——知道什么是好的、为什么好。</li>\n<li><strong>想象力（Imagination）</strong>：系统能够主动设定新的创作目标，而不是被动地响应指令。这是最难实现的维度，因为它要求某种形式的内在动机（intrinsic motivation）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Colton 的关键论点是：如果一个系统只有技巧而缺乏鉴赏力和想象力，它更像一个工具而非创造者。当前的大型语言模型在技巧维度表现出色，在鉴赏力维度有所进展（通过 RLHF 等机制），但在想象力维度仍然严重不足。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-specs-评估框架\">三、SPECS 评估框架</h3><p>Jordanous 提出的 SPECS（Standardised Procedure for Evaluating Creative Systems）框架为评估计算创造力提供了三步标准化流程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S</td>\n<td>Step 1: 识别</td>\n<td>明确定义&quot;创造力&quot;在目标领域中的含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P</td>\n<td>Step 2: 操作化</td>\n<td>将定义转化为可测量的指标和测试方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E+C+S</td>\n<td>Step 3: 评估</td>\n<td>使用标准化流程执行评估并报告结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SPECS 的核心贡献在于承认创造力的领域依赖性（domain-dependence）。音乐创造力、视觉创造力、文学创造力有不同的评价标准，SPECS 要求研究者先明确领域定义，再设计评估方案，避免跨领域的不当比较。</p>\n<p>Jordanous 进一步通过语料库分析提炼出创造力的 14 个组成要素，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>新颖性与原创性</strong>（novelty and originality）</li>\n<li><strong>价值与质量</strong>（value and quality）</li>\n<li><strong>意图与目标导向</strong>（intention and goal-directedness）</li>\n<li><strong>社会互动与沟通</strong>（social interaction and communication）</li>\n<li><strong>变异、分歧与实验</strong>（variety, divergence, experimentation）</li>\n<li><strong>自发性与潜意识过程</strong>（spontaneity and subconscious processing）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-计算创造力-vs-生成式-ai-概念边界\">四、计算创造力 vs. 生成式 AI：概念边界</h3><p>&quot;计算创造力&quot;和&quot;生成式 AI&quot;经常被混用，但两者有重要的概念区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>计算创造力</th>\n<th>生成式 AI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心关切</td>\n<td>创造力的本质与模拟</td>\n<td>高质量内容生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评价标准</td>\n<td>新颖性 + 价值 + 惊奇性</td>\n<td>保真度 + 多样性 + 可控性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理论基础</td>\n<td>认知科学、哲学、心理学</td>\n<td>统计学习、概率模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自主性要求</td>\n<td>高（系统应有内在动机）</td>\n<td>低（响应用户指令即可）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型系统</td>\n<td>The Painting Fool, DARCI</td>\n<td>DALL-E, GPT, Midjourney</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生成式 AI 的&quot;创造力&quot;往往是训练数据分布的插值（interpolation）——在已见样本构成的流形上进行平滑采样。计算创造力研究者追问的是：系统能否超越插值，产出真正位于训练分布之外的新颖产出？</p>\n<p>设训练数据分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{data}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，模型学到的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。纯插值意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>supp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mtext>supp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{supp}(P_{\\theta}) \\subseteq \\text{supp}(P_{\\text{data}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">supp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">supp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，而真正的创造力要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>supp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exists x \\in \\text{supp}(P_{\\theta})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">supp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mtext>supp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\notin \\text{supp}(P_{\\text{data}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">supp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 具有价值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-机器创造力的哲学争议\">五、机器创造力的哲学争议</h3><p><strong>Lovelace 反对意见（The Lovelace Objection）</strong></p>\n<p>Ada Lovelace 在 1843 年写道：&quot;分析引擎没有任何创造的野心。它能做的，只是我们知道如何命令它执行的事情。&quot; 这一论点长期被用来否定机器创造力的可能性。</p>\n<p>现代回应有两个方向：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>弱回应</strong>：复杂系统中的涌现行为可以超越设计者的预期。一个遵循简单规则的元胞自动机可以产出设计者未预见的复杂模式——这是否算&quot;创造&quot;？</li>\n<li><strong>强回应</strong>：Boden 指出，人类创造力同样受制于神经架构和文化经验，&quot;自由意志&quot;可能只是一种有用的幻觉。如果人类的创造力也是某种&quot;计算过程&quot;的结果，那么否定机器创造力就需要证明人类创造力中存在某种非计算的成分。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>创造力的图灵测试</strong></p>\n<p>类比图灵测试的思路，一些研究者提出了创造力的行为判据：如果一个系统的产出被不知情的评委认为是有创意的人类作品，那么该系统就展现了创造力。但这面临与原始图灵测试相同的批评——行为等价不等于内在状态等价。</p>\n<p><strong>产出 vs. 过程之争</strong></p>\n<p>创造力应该由产出（product）还是过程（process）来判断？</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产出导向：只要结果新颖且有价值，创造力就成立（不关心如何产出的）</li>\n<li>过程导向：真正的创造力要求特定类型的认知过程（如 insight、类比推理），随机组合不算创造力</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一争议直接影响对 AI 艺术的评价。一幅由扩散模型生成的惊艳画作——如果其生成过程只是噪声到图像的梯度下降，它&quot;有创意&quot;吗？</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-评估计算创造力的操作化指标\">六、评估计算创造力的操作化指标</h3><p>将上述理论框架操作化，研究者发展出若干可测量的指标：</p>\n<p><strong>新颖性（Novelty）</strong> 通常通过与已知作品的距离来衡量。在特征空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 中，产出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的新颖性可定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Nov</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow></munder><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Nov}(x) = \\min_{y \\in D_{\\text{ref}}} d(f(x), f(y))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Nov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6304em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为参考作品集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 为特征提取函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为距离函数。</p>\n<p><strong>惊奇性（Surprise）</strong> 与期望的违背程度相关。Boden 区分了 P-creativity（对个体而言的新颖）和 H-creativity（对整个人类历史而言的新颖）。惊奇性可以建模为负对数似然：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Surp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>context</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Surp}(x) = -\\log P(x \\mid \\text{context})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Surp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">context</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>价值（Value）</strong> 是最难量化的维度。它涉及审美判断、功能性、文化语境等多重因素，通常依赖人类评估者。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    N[Novelty&lt;br/&gt;新颖性] --- C[Creativity&lt;br/&gt;创造力]&#10;    V[Value&lt;br/&gt;价值] --- C&#10;    S[Surprise&lt;br/&gt;惊奇性] --- C&#10;    C --&gt; E[评估方法]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[自动化指标]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[专家评审]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[用户研究]\">graph LR\n    N[Novelty&lt;br/&gt;新颖性] --- C[Creativity&lt;br/&gt;创造力]\n    V[Value&lt;br/&gt;价值] --- C\n    S[Surprise&lt;br/&gt;惊奇性] --- C\n    C --&gt; E[评估方法]\n    E --&gt; E1[自动化指标]\n    E --&gt; E2[专家评审]\n    E --&gt; E3[用户研究]</pre><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>概念辨析</strong>：选择一个你熟悉的 AI 艺术生成系统（如 Midjourney、DALL-E、Suno），分析它主要展现了 Boden 三类创造力中的哪一种。它是否有可能展现变革性创造力？为什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Creative Tripod 评估</strong>：用 Colton 的创造三脚架模型评估 ChatGPT 的诗歌创作能力。在&quot;技巧&quot;、&quot;鉴赏力&quot;、&quot;想象力&quot;三个维度上，分别给出你的评级（1-5）并论证理由。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>SPECS 实践</strong>：选择一个具体的创造力领域（如音乐即兴、视觉构图、叙事结构），按照 SPECS 框架的三个步骤，设计一个评估方案来比较人类艺术家和 AI 系统的创造力表现。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>哲学立场声明</strong>：在&quot;产出导向&quot;和&quot;过程导向&quot;之间，你倾向于哪种立场？如果采用产出导向，你是否愿意承认一个随机生成器偶然产出的杰作具有&quot;创造力&quot;？如果采用过程导向，你如何回应&quot;我们并不了解人类创造过程的全部细节&quot;这一反驳？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>思想实验</strong>：假设一个 AI 系统经过训练后，能够可靠地产出被专家认定为&quot;变革性&quot;的艺术作品——它改变了某个艺术流派的规则。但该系统的内部机制仍然是梯度下降和参数更新。这是否构成真正的变革性创造力？用 Boden 的框架论证你的答案。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p><strong>核心文献</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Margaret Boden, <em>The Creative Mind: Myths and Mechanisms</em> (2nd ed., 2004) — 计算创造力领域的奠基之作，系统阐述三类创造力分类及其认知科学基础</li>\n<li>Simon Colton, &quot;Creativity Versus the Perception of Creativity in Computational Systems&quot; (AAAI 2008) — 创造三脚架模型的原始论文，区分了&quot;真正的创造力&quot;和&quot;被感知的创造力&quot;</li>\n<li>Anna Jordanous, &quot;A Standardised Procedure for Evaluating Creative Systems: Computational Creativity Evaluation Based on What It Is to Be Creative&quot; (Cognitive Computation, 2012) — SPECS 框架的完整描述</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>哲学与认知科学方向</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ada Lovelace, &quot;Note A&quot; in <em>Sketch of the Analytical Engine</em> (1843) — Lovelace 反对意见的原始文本</li>\n<li>Douglas Hofstadter &amp; FARG, <em>Fluid Concepts and Creative Analogies</em> (1995) — 类比作为创造力核心机制的计算模型</li>\n<li>Mark Riedl, &quot;The Lovelace 2.0 Test of Artificial Creativity and Intelligence&quot; (2014) — 对 Lovelace 反对意见的现代重新表述和操作化</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>应用与实践方向</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Colton et al., &quot;Computational Creativity: The Final Frontier?&quot; (ECAI 2012) — 计算创造力研究的全景综述和未来方向</li>\n<li>International Conference on Computational Creativity (ICCC) — 该领域的顶级学术会议，每年发表最新研究</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>跨领域连接</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>认知心理学中的&quot;固着效应&quot;（fixation effect）和&quot;孵化期&quot;（incubation period）如何启发计算创造力系统的设计</li>\n<li>进化计算中的&quot;新颖性搜索&quot;（novelty search）算法与 Boden 探索性创造力的对应关系</li>\n<li>社会建构主义视角：Csikszentmihalyi 的系统模型（个人-领域-场域）对计算创造力评估的启示</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>计算创造力理论为我们理解和评估 AI 的创造性行为提供了严谨的分析框架。Boden 的三分法（探索性、组合性、变革性）定义了创造力的类型空间；Colton 的创造三脚架（技巧、鉴赏力、想象力）提供了评估维度；SPECS 框架则标准化了评估流程。</p>\n<p>当前生成式 AI 系统主要展现探索性和组合性创造力，在变革性创造力和自主想象力方面仍有根本性局限。哲学层面，Lovelace 反对意见的现代变体提醒我们，行为表现与内在状态之间的鸿沟尚未被弥合——&quot;看起来有创意&quot;与&quot;真正具有创造力&quot;可能是两个截然不同的命题。</p>\n<p>对于艺术与科技的研究者而言，关键不在于急于下结论（机器&quot;能&quot;或&quot;不能&quot;创造），而在于精确地使用这些理论工具来分析具体系统的创造力特征，并在此基础上推进对创造力本身的理解。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士 艺术与科技前沿 — 计算创造力理论","id":"博士-艺术与科技前沿-计算创造力理论"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、Boden 的创造力三分法","id":"一-boden-的创造力三分法"},{"level":3,"text":"二、Colton 的创造三脚架","id":"二-colton-的创造三脚架"},{"level":3,"text":"三、SPECS 评估框架","id":"三-specs-评估框架"},{"level":3,"text":"四、计算创造力 vs. 生成式 AI：概念边界","id":"四-计算创造力-vs-生成式-ai-概念边界"},{"level":3,"text":"五、机器创造力的哲学争议","id":"五-机器创造力的哲学争议"},{"level":3,"text":"六、评估计算创造力的操作化指标","id":"六-评估计算创造力的操作化指标"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"博士 艺术与科技前沿 — 生成艺术系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/arts/arts-and-technology/ai-creativity/generative-art-systems"}}